{
    "title": "Solitaire Journey:Romance Time",
    "description": "Welcome to Solitaire Journey: Romance Time, your go-to destination for a relaxing and fast-paced solitaire experience! Immerse yourself in the solitaire story filled with pretty girls, making it a stress reliever like no other. Unleash the excitement of solitaire as you unlock scenes and collect diverse beauties \u201ctoo hot to handle\u201c. Trust me, it really worth your time!\r\nSolitaire Journey: Romance Time goes beyond the norm with free solitaire games, ensuring an ad-free gaming experience. Become a solitaire winner and delve into solitaire romance that's truly captivating. \r\n\r\n- Play journey to unlock beauties that specifically designed for you\r\n- Exciting journey filled with romantic background, challenging level design and mysterious beauties revelations\r\n- Diverse beauties too hot to handle \r\n- Set beauty selfies as your game background, let her be your eternal companion\r\n \r\nEmbark on a solitaire journey that combines the thrill of matching card games with the elegance of solitaire resort games. This solitaire collection offers a fun and free solitaire match, ensuring a perfect match for solitaire enthusiasts. Enjoy the solitaire perfect match with our easy tap or drag controls, making it the ideal solitaire for free.\r\n\r\nHave fun with solitaire classic card game. It brings you with fun, realistic and challenging Solitaire classic gameplay you know. You can enjoy a beautiful, modern design, and easy-to-read hearts cards game experience. Meanwhile, Facebook game is also available!\r\n\r\nTest your skills and patience with our solitaire card games! Train your brain, play the Solitaire Classic Card Game and wander in the solitaire world.\r\n\r\nSharpen your mind and play the ORIGINAL Free solitaire card game on Google Play!\r\n\r\n\u2660 Solitaire, also known as Patience, is the most addictive game and enjoyed by millions of card game players in the solitaire world with the strategy of 3 Card (3 Pass) Solitaire and 1 Card (1 Pass) Solitaire. \r\n\r\n\u2660 Try our best solitaire card app, which is easy and addictive, just like the mouse game of  Windows Solitaire\u2122. This is a wonderful solitaire play experience! \r\n\r\n\u2660 Are you bored with Solitaire apps that always seem to have the same rough gameplay and tired of in-app purchase games? Try this genuine version of Free Solitaire collection App. This Solitaire has better gameplay than any other Solitaire on the market, including Microsoft solitaire. Free Classic Solitaire is easy to download on your phone or tablet so that you can play it anytime, anywhere!\r\n\r\n== Basic Features ==      \r\n\u2022 Enjoy the romantic journey\r\n\u2022 Unlock more scenes\r\n\u2022 Train your brain and patience                                                            \r\n\u2022 Enjoy our easy tap or drag controls\r\n\u2022 Five stars certified\r\n\u2022 Single player mode\r\n\u2022 Offline mode\r\n\u2022 Classic Solitaire gameplay\r\n\u2022 Unlimited free hints and undos\r\n\u2022 Left-handed Mode available \r\n\u2022 Selection from Classic or Vegas Scoring\r\n\u2022 Beautiful HD graphics\r\n\u2022 Additional game modes: 100% winnable deals and Vegas solitaire scoring\r\n\r\nWelcom explore golf solitaire, wild solitaire, and fairway frenzy for a dynamic solitaire experience. Dive into the world of solitaire fish 3D, solitaire animals, solitaire zoo, and solitaire fish master for a variety of captivating themes. Explore the charm of castle solitaire, solitaire farm, and vita adventures within this comprehensive solitaire card board games app.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udea9Now! Join the ranks of the most popular solitaire players, engage in free solitaire and discover the joy of card and board games within this comprehensive solitaire card board games app in any of your mobile devices. Download Solitaire Journey: Romance Time now for the ultimate solitaire fun card game, featuring solitaire resort and a variety of card and board games. Don't miss out on the excitement \u2013 play the solitaire with a twist!",
